---
name: {{NAME}}
description: {{PURPOSE}}. Runs full lanes via workflow or tick.
---

Run the conductor. Do not spawn lanes by hand. Do not nested grok -p.

1. OUT absolute (default from env or ~/Desktop/puma/docs/{{NAME}} or similar)
2. `bash ~/.grok/skills/{{NAME}}/scripts/ctl.sh auto --out OUT [--lanes ...]`
3. Launch `workflow name={{NAME}} args.out=OUT args.lanes=...`
4. Optional: watch with `ctl.sh watch --out OUT`
5. Tick mode for periodic remainder: `ctl.sh tick --out OUT` then {{NAME}}-tick workflow.

Always runs lead + sync on tick. Skips READY lanes with on-disk artifacts.
